<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Company&#8217;s stockholders approved, for
the purposes of complying with Nasdaq Listing Rules, the issuance of Shares issuable pursuant to the Merger Agreement, the Repayment Agreement,
