<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Company&#8217;s stockholders approved, pursuant
to Nevada Revised Statute 78.2055, a reverse stock split of the outstanding Shares by a ratio of any whole number between 1-for-8 and
1-for-12, at any time prior to June 30, 2026, to be determined by the Board.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>&#160;</b></p>

