<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b><i>&#160;</i></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Company&#8217;s stockholders elected all eight
nominees to serve as directors until the 2026 annual meeting of the stockholders of the Company, or until such directors&#8217; successors
have been duly elected or qualified, or until such directors&#8217; earlier death, resignation, retirement, or removal.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b><i>&#160;</i></b></p>

